# Backend API Domain

## Production API Domain

The production backend API is served at **`https://api.infinitycolor.co`**.

All code fallbacks use this domain. Never use `api.new.infinitycolor.co` or `api.infinitycolor.org` for production.

## Environment Variable Override Pattern

Environment variables **override** hardcoded fallbacks in code. When adding new API URL references:

### Backend

- **`URL`**: Full backend base URL (e.g. `https://api.infinitycolor.co`)
- **`SAMAN_CALLBACK_URL`**: `https://api.infinitycolor.co/api/wallet/payment-callback`
- **`SNAPPAY_RETURN_URL`**: `https://api.infinitycolor.co/api/orders/payment-callback`

### Frontend

- **`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`**: `https://api.infinitycolor.co/api`
- **`NEXT_PUBLIC_IMAGE_BASE_URL`**: `https://api.infinitycolor.co/`

### Code Pattern

```typescript
const baseUrl = process.env.URL || "https://api.infinitycolor.co";
const apiUrl = process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL || "https://api.infinitycolor.co/api";
```

